{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hkEjtxDIRR1793261030.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超及官員見記者，交代宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告。財政司司長陳茂波指，政府將成立樓宇維修支援及服務局主導工作，支援業主在不同階段，提供代辦服務。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203513-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%93%B23%E5%84%84%E8%A8%AD%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E5%B1%80%E6%8E%A5%E7%AE%A1%E5%B8%82%E5%BB%BA%E5%B1%80%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜政府擲3億設樓宇維修局　接管市建局服務｜一文看清</a></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:02.082560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:18:06.659016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:22.749342+00:00","content_hash":"920b0855ced727257fd567fc8e46ee193928e213178bebb4d7a4d4f043d3a8d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:02.082560+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}